{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q422994","formula":"CHClF₂","hill":"CHClF2","elements":["H","C","F","Cl"],"composition":{"C":1.0,"F":2.0,"H":1.0,"Cl":1.0},"names":{"en":"Chlorodifluoromethane","ru":"Хлордифторметан","uk":"Дифторхлорметан"},"descriptions":{"en":"Chlorodifluoromethane or difluoromonochloromethane is a hydrochlorofluorocarbon (HCFC). This colorless gas is better known as HCFC-22, or R-22, or CHClF2. It was commonly used as a propellant and refrigerant.","ru":"Дифторхлормета́н (также фрео́н R-22, хла̀даге́нт R-22, хладо́н-22) — органическое вещество, трижды замещённый галогеналкан, производное метана, фреон, химическая формула CHClF2. Бесцветный газ со слабым запахом хлороформа. Более ядовит, чем дифтордихлорметан, не взрывоопасен и не горюч.","uk":"Дифторхлорметан (також Фреон R-22, Хладагент R-22, Хладон-22) — фреон, хімічна формула CHClF2. Безбарвний газ зі слабким запахом хлороформу, більш отруйний, ніж R-12, не вибухонебезпечний і не горючий. У порівнянні з R-12 холодоагент R-22 гірше розчиняється в оливі, але легко проникає через нещільності й нейтральний до металів."},"fame":32,"pubchemCid":6372,"mass":86.47,"charge":0,"smiles":"C(F)(F)Cl","inchikey":"VOPWNXZWBYDODV-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"chloro(difluoro)methane","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"6372","atoms":5,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-1.586,"y":0.0,"z":0.1,"el":"Cl"},{"x":0.738,"y":1.089,"z":0.135,"el":"F"},{"x":0.738,"y":-1.089,"z":0.135,"el":"F"},{"x":0.11,"y":0.0,"z":-0.371,"el":"C"},{"x":0.204,"y":0.0,"z":-1.46,"el":"H"}],"bonds":[[0,3,1],[1,3,1],[2,3,1],[3,4,1]]},"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q422994","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chlorodifluoromethane","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (ru)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%94%D0%B8%D1%84%D1%82%D0%BE%D1%80%D1%85%D0%BB%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%BC%D0%B5%D1%82%D0%B0%D0%BD","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (uk)","url":"https://uk.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%94%D0%B8%D1%84%D1%82%D0%BE%D1%80%D1%85%D0%BB%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%BC%D0%B5%D1%82%D0%B0%D0%BD","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"properties","name":"PubChem","url":"https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/6372","license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},{"role":"structure","name":"PubChem 3D","url":"https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/6372#section=3D-Conformer","license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"}],"similar":[{"id":"Q1869625","formula":"C₂HCl₂F₃","names":{"en":"2,2-dichloro-1,1,1-trifluoroethane"},"elements":["H","C","F","Cl"],"fame":15,"kind":"molecule"},{"id":"Q27282088","formula":"C₂HCl₂F₃","names":{"en":"1,2-dichloro-1,1,2-trifluoroethane"},"elements":["H","C","F","Cl"],"fame":8,"kind":"molecule"},{"id":"Q32921","formula":"C₂HBrClF₃","names":{"en":"Halothane","ru":"Галотан","uk":"Галотан"},"elements":["H","C","F","Cl","Br"],"fame":44,"kind":"molecule"},{"id":"Q752098","formula":"C₂HClF₄","names":{"en":"1,1,1,2-tetrafluorochloroethane"},"elements":["H","C","F","Cl"],"fame":13,"kind":"molecule"},{"id":"Q410612","formula":"CHF₃","names":{"en":"Fluoroform","ru":"Фтороформ"},"elements":["H","C","F"],"fame":29,"kind":"molecule"},{"id":"Q418163","formula":"CHCl₂F","names":{"en":"Dichlorofluoromethane","ru":"Фтордихлорметан"},"elements":["H","C","F","Cl"],"fame":20,"kind":"molecule"},{"id":"Q2354896","formula":"CHBrF₂","names":{"en":"Bromodifluoromethane","ru":"Бромдифторметан"},"elements":["H","C","F","Br"],"fame":19,"kind":"molecule"},{"id":"Q27278838","formula":"C₃HCl₂F₅","names":{"en":"1,3-dichloro-1,1,2,2,3-pentafluoropropane"},"elements":["H","C","F","Cl"],"fame":3,"kind":"molecule"}],"photo":null}